# The total cost of Dragonfire Blade's equip ability is determined from the target announced and then locked in (CR
# 601.2f, 602.2b): what happens to the target afterwards changes nothing paid. Bot1 equips the black and red Bloodtithe
# Harvester for {2} ({B}{R} from the pool); Bot2 answers with Lightning Bolt and the Harvester dies. The equip ability
# finds its only target gone and does nothing (CR 608.2b), the Blade stays unattached, and the {B}{R} stays spent: no
# mana comes back, and nothing more was asked (Sol Ring and Mox Pearl are still untapped).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Bloodtithe Harvester
Mox Pearl
Sol Ring
Dragonfire Blade
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Island x15

